					"tooltip": "<spellPassive>Passive</spellPassive>: Yunara deal <magicDamage>@Calc_Passive_Damage@ magic damage</magicDamage> <OnHit>%i:OnHit% On-Hit</OnHit> and attacking grants <evolve>@Resource_Nonchampion@ Unleash</evolve> (<evolve>@Resource_Champion@ Unleash</evolve> for champions).<br><br><spellPassive>Active</spellPassive>: Yunara consumes <evolve>@Resource_Max@ Unleash</evolve> and for @Buff_Duration@ seconds gains <attackSpeed>@Calc_Attack_Speed@ Attack Speed</attackSpeed> and deals an additional <magicDamage>@Calc_Damage@ magic damage</magicDamage> <OnHit>%i:OnHit% On-Hit</OnHit>. During this time, her Attacks spread to nearby enemies dealing them <physicalDamage>@Calc_Damage_Spread@ physical damage</physicalDamage>.<br><br><keywordMajor>Transcendent State</keywordMajor>: This Ability is instantly activated for @Spell.YunaraR:Buff_Duration@ seconds.",
